:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为多仓协作准备本地工作面；每个 id clone 或 update 一次，并打印解析路径"
,
"en"
:
"Prepare a multi-repo local workspace; clone-or-update each id and print resolved paths"
}
,
"id..."
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"每个 id 经 update_one 处理；输出每行一个解析后的主路径，供 ../<sibling> 引用"
,
"en"
:
"Each id goes through update_one; output is one resolved main path per line, ready for ../<sibling> references"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 prepare 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show prepare help"
}
}
}
,
"card"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为仓库生成 YAML 评分卡：1 次 GraphQL（合并 8 个 search 计数）+ 2 次 REST commits，全程 API，不碰本地 clone"
,
"en"
:
"Emit a YAML scorecard for a repo: 1 GraphQL (carrying 8 aliased search counts) + 2 REST commits, API-only, no local clone touched"
}
,
"id"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id（如 x-cmd/install）；接受 owner/repo、gh/owner/repo、github.com/owner/repo；末尾 @wtname 会被剥离"
,
"en"
:
"Repo id (e.g. x-cmd/install); accepts owner/repo, gh/owner/repo, github.com/owner/repo; trailing @wtname is stripped"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"不再触碰本地 clone：head / lastCommit / recentCommit 全部走 GitHub API（GraphQL `defaultBranchRef.target.oid` / `committedDate` 和 REST `/commits?since=DATE`）。这意味着 `x repo card` 在仓库尚未 clone 时也能直接跑，不需要先 `x repo <id>` 拉一份到本地。\n"
,
"en"
:
"No local clone dependency: head / lastCommit / recentCommit all come from the GitHub API (GraphQL `defaultBranchRef.target.oid` / `committedDate` and REST `/commits?since=DATE`). This means `x repo card` runs even on repos you haven't cloned yet — no need to `x repo <id>` first.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"适合给 install / scorecard 这类场景喂数据。输出是 YAML（YAML 1.2 是 JSON 的超集对这些字段而言），如果下游要按字段抽取，可以走管道后用 yq 处理；目前没有 `--json` / `--yml` 之类的 flag。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Built to feed downstream tooling. Output is YAML (YAML 1.2 is a JSON superset for these scalar fields). Pipe into yq for field extraction; no `--json` / `--yml` flag yet.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"卡片分四段：`github:` 是所有静态指标；`recent:` 集中所有窗口化指标，按 last30d、last90d、last180d 和 last360d 两组输出；`detail:` 只放 API 返回的 head；`language:` + `totalLine:` 是 linguist 字节构成。末尾 `collectedAt:` 标明采集时刻。\n"
,
"en"
:
"The card has four sections: `github:` for every static metric, `recent:` for every windowed metric grouped by last30d, last90d, last180d, and last360d, `detail:` for the API-derived HEAD ref, `language:` + `totalLine:` for GitHub linguist's byte stats. A final `collectedAt:` line names the moment of emission.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**单次调用成本**：3 个 HTTP 请求（1 个 GraphQL + 2 个 REST `/commits`），实测 GraphQL ~1 point / card。完整设计演进在 `story/260824.x-repo-card-graphql-consolidation.md`。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**Per-call cost**: 3 HTTP requests (1 GraphQL + 2 REST `/commits`), measured ~1 GraphQL point per card. Full design story at `story/260824.x-repo-card-graphql-consolidation.md`.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**GitHub 认证**：card 需要 token 才能稳（未鉴权时 GraphQL 降到 60 req/h）。优先使用 `gh auth login` 后由 `gh auth token` 提供；也可设置 `GH_TOKEN` 或 `GITHUB_TOKEN`。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**GitHub auth**: card needs a token to be reliable (anonymous GraphQL caps at 60 req/h). Token resolution order: `gh auth token`, then `$GH_TOKEN`, then `$GITHUB_TOKEN`.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**totalLine 是字节数**：GraphQL 的 `languages.edges[].size` 来自 GitHub 的 linguist，是字节而非行数。字段名保留 `totalLine` 是为了对齐 x-cmd/install#86 的 InstallCardMeta；需要真实行数请另外跑 tokei。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**totalLine is bytes, not lines**: GraphQL's `languages.edges[].size` comes from GitHub's linguist and counts bytes, not source lines. The field is named `totalLine` for parity with the InstallCardMeta schema in x-cmd/install#86; run tokei separately for true line counts.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**contributor 是估算**：GitHub GraphQL 不暴露真正的 contributors（`collaborators` 对非管理员返回 FORBIDDEN），所以 card 取的是 `mentionableUsers.totalCount`。org 名下的仓库会把所有 org 成员都算进去——当成上界看就好。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**contributor is approximate**: GitHub's GraphQL doesn't expose the real contributors list without admin access (`collaborators` returns FORBIDDEN to read-only callers), so card uses `mentionableUsers.totalCount` as the closest proxy. For org-owned repos this overcounts every org member — treat the field as an upper bound.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**recent.star 在大型仓库可能为 0**：GitHub GraphQL 的 `stargazers(orderBy:STARRED_AT, first:100)` 在 star 数 ≥ 几万级别的仓库上会返回空 edges（GitHub 已知 bug）。小仓库（< 几千 star）一般正常。对于 x-cmd 这种几十 star 的项目，star30 / star90 都能正确反映；如果看的是热门仓库，star 字段就直接忽略看其它指标吧。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**recent.star may be 0 on large repos**: GitHub GraphQL's `stargazers(orderBy:STARRED_AT, first:100)` returns empty edges on repos with tens of thousands of stars (known GitHub bug). Small repos (< a few thousand stars) usually work. For popular repos, ignore the star field and read the others.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"**recent 字段来源**：recent.star 和 recent.fork 走 GraphQL（`stargazers(first:100)` / `forks(first:100)` 按时间倒序，jq 客户端按 publishedAt / createdAt 过滤）；recent.release 同样在 GraphQL 拿 releases(first:100) 后过滤；recent.mergedPR / recent.openPR / recent.closedIssue / recent.openIssue 走 GraphQL 的 8 个 root-level `search(...)` alias（同一个 query 里），每个返回 issueCount；recent.commit 走 REST `/commits?since=DATE`。所有这些都不依赖本地 clone。\n"
,
"en"
:
"**recent* sources**: recentStar and recentFork come from GraphQL (`stargazers(first:100)` / `forks(first:100)` filtered client-side by date). recentRelease is filtered from `releases(first:100)` similarly. recentMergedPR / recentOpenPR / recentClosedIssue / recentOpenIssue come from 8 root-level GraphQL `search(...)` aliases in the same query (each returns `issueCount`). recentCommit is REST `/commits?since=DATE`. None of these require a local clone.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card jqlang/jq"
,
"cn"
:
"基本用法: 输出 YAML 评分卡（默认最近 90 天窗口）"
,
"en"
:
"Basic: emit a YAML scorecard (4 fixed windows: 30d / 90d / 180d / 360d)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card x-cmd/install | yq '.github'"
,
"cn"
:
"抽取 github 段: yq 拿结构化数据"
,
"en"
:
"Extract the github section via yq"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo card stedolan/jq > card.yml"
,
"cn"
:
"YAML 文件落地: 重定向到文件供后续工具消费"
,
"en"
:
"Persist as YAML: redirect to a file for downstream tooling"
}
]
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 card 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show card help"
}
}
}
,
"init"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"把空裸库推进到 initialized 状态：scaffold 一份最小 README，commit 后 push 到 main，再 attach 默认 wt"
,
"en"
:
"Push an empty bare from uninitialized to initialized: scaffold a minimal README, commit, push to main, then attach the default worktree"
}
,
"id"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id（如 x-bash/repo）；裸库不存在则先 clone --bare"
,
"en"
:
"Repo id (e.g. x-bash/repo); clones the bare first if it doesn't exist"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 init 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show init help"
}
}
}
,
"wt"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"管理 worktree：创建或 attach（默认）、显式 create、列出（ls）、删除（rm）；仅做 worktree 层面的包装，不参与 git fetch/merge"
,
"en"
:
"Manage worktrees: create-or-attach (default), explicit create, list (ls), remove (rm); a thin worktree-only wrapper, does not fetch or merge"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x repo wt <id> <branch>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x repo wt create <id> <branch>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x repo wt ls <id>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x repo wt rm <id> <branch>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#subcmd:wt"
:
[
"create"
,
"ls"
,
"rm"
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt x-bash/repo feat/auth"
,
"cn"
:
"默认: 在 feat/auth 上创建或 attach（缺则从 HEAD 新建，存在则 attach）"
,
"en"
:
"Default: create-or-attach on feat/auth (new branch from HEAD if absent, attaches otherwise)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt ls x-bash/repo"
,
"cn"
:
"列出 worktree: 裸库 + 默认 wt + 额外的 wt"
,
"en"
:
"List worktrees: bare + default wt + extras"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x repo wt rm x-bash/repo feat/auth"
,
"cn"
:
"优雅删除: git worktree remove；不要手动 rm -rf"
,
"en"
:
"Graceful remove via git worktree remove; never rm -rf directly"
}
]
,
"create"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"为 <id> 在 <branch> 上创建 worktree（显式 create）；等价于默认形式 x repo wt <id> <branch>"
,
"en"
:
"Create a worktree for <id> on <branch> (explicit form); equivalent to the default x repo wt <id> <branch>"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id，可带 / 前缀走 fuzzywhich"
,
"en"
:
"Repository id; accepts /-prefixed fuzzy query"
}
}
,
"#2"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要在其上创建或 attach worktree 的分支名；缺则从 HEAD 新建，存在则 attach"
,
"en"
:
"Branch on which to create or attach the worktree; created from HEAD if absent, attached otherwise"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 create 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show create help"
}
}
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出 <id> 仓库的所有 worktree（裸库 + 默认 wt + 额外的 wt；裸库自己不出现在 git worktree list 里）"
,
"en"
:
"List all worktrees of <id> (bare + default wt + extras; the bare itself is not in git worktree list)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id，可带 / 前缀走 fuzzywhich"
,
"en"
:
"Repository id; accepts /-prefixed fuzzy query"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 ls 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show ls help"
}
}
}
,
"rm"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"优雅删除 <id> 上名为 <branch> 的 worktree；走 git worktree remove，bare 的 worktrees/ 登记表自动同步；不要手动 rm -rf"
,
"en"
:
"Graceful remove of the worktree for <branch> on <id>; uses git worktree remove and syncs bare's worktrees/ registry; never rm -rf directly"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"仓库 id，可带 / 前缀走 fuzzywhich"
,
"en"
:
"Repository id; accepts /-prefixed fuzzy query"
}
}
,
"#2"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要删除的 worktree 对应分支名；必须对应已 attach 的 worktree，否则 git 报错"
,
"en"
:
"Branch name of the worktree to remove; must match an attached worktree, otherwise git errors"
}
}
,
"-h"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 rm 帮助"
,
"en"
:
"Show rm help"
}
}
}
}
}

